        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2194, Knurled Rectangular Dummy Pocket Door Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Narrow Rectangular Dummy Pocket Door Set features a unique knurled designed meant to match perfectly with all of Emtek Knurled Door Hardware. It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a dummy mortise that has a cutout to accept a latch from a keyed or privacy pocket door mortise. This makes it able to be used on the inactive side of a pair of sliding doors. The Knurled Dummy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is one of the first with the knurled design, so you can be on the leading edge of modern home decor.  It is available in a wide selection of finishes ranging from classic to trendy, so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Dummy Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket and a cutout to accept a latch from a keyed or privacy pocket door mortise.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2194-1215444\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2195-1215183\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-keyed-entry-pocket-door-set-emtek-2193-1215481\"><b>Keyed Entry Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Knurled Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Height: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3.43\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2194_2196-specifications.pdf?v=1774586581\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 2194 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a dummy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
